  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Tuesday 1 December 2026 at 3:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nDiscover modern, easy-care living in this stunning, four-bedroom home, perfectly positioned in the sought-after Bucklands Beach area.\r\n\r\nDesigned with comfort and convenience in mind, this stylish two-level home offers four generous double bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms (including a master ensuite and guest toilet), and a single internal-access garage.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features a spacious open-plan living and dining area, complemented by a sleek, modern kitchen. Whether you're entertaining guests or enjoying quality family time, this inviting space is designed for effortless everyday living.\r\n\r\nStep outside to a fully fenced, low-maintenance backyard, complete with a pergola – an ideal spot for outdoor dining, relaxing or entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, all four double bedrooms are thoughtfully positioned away from the main living areas, offering privacy and a peaceful retreat for the whole family.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include plumbed gas cooking and heat pumps, ensuring year-round comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a fantastic location close to Highland Park Shopping Centre, Pak'nSave, Lloyd Elsmore Park, local restaurants and other everyday amenities. Families will also appreciate the convenience of nearby schools, with the property zoned for Macleans Primary School, Howick Intermediate and Pakuranga College.\r\n\r\nOffering the perfect combination of modern style, practical living and a convenient location, this beautiful home is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing or visit one of our open homes!\r\n\r\nPlease note: All photos are from the previous listing.",
